    "created_at": "2019-09-08T23:37:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-08T23:37:50Z",
    "body": "Not impossible, but right now `starship` is launched as a new process (via `startship prompt`), every time the prompt is drawn. To implement this we would need to cache this data out of process somewhere.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
