    "created_at": "2019-09-09T00:00:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-09T00:00:27Z",
    "body": "In fact, we can see that forcing a pagecache clear before running `starship prompt` significantly affects the runtime, but we should almost never hit this worst-case scenario unless the user runs their system out of memory (and the page cache for starship.toml is dropped)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4605384/64496458-dc8b6500-d26a-11e9-8601-4c608b1c769d.png)\r\n",
